<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin 4-wk T-bill yield 8.98 pct (8.77pct).</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin 4-wk T-bill yield 8.98 pct (8.77pct).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at a Slovak Finance Ministry four-week treasury bill auction hit 8.98 percent, up from 8.77 percent in the last auction of similar bills, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					   Oct 9	    Oct 2</p>
<p> Bids (billion crowns)	     3.060	    2.746</p>
<p> Bids accepted			 2.150	    2.546</p>
<p> Minimum yield (pct)		 8.900	    8.400</p>
<p> Average yield (pct)		 8.981	    8.774</p>
<p> Maximum yield (pct)		 9.000	    9.000</p>
<p> Maturity date			 Oct 31	   Oct 24</p>
<p>Note. The NBS said it took 1.85 billion crowns worth of T-bills into its portfolio at the auction.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
